          "You must thoroughly understand the conversion mechanics of decentralized networks—how to swap digital tokens for tangible goods across borders without ever relying on legacy banking infrastructure.",
          "Resource management is entirely meaningless without secure storage; you must construct physical and digital \"Fortress of Solitude\" vaults that remain fundamentally inaccessible to institutional overreach or digital surveillance.",
