          "Anticipate inevitable environmental decay; engineering and acquiring large-scale filtration systems to guarantee clean air and water is not paranoia, it is baseline industrial preparation for future scarcity.",
          "The Rule of Three for inventory management is an absolute law: if you have three of an essential item, you have two; if you have two, you have one; if you have one, you have none. Equipment will fail, and redundancies will save your life.",
